Subject: [PATCH 1/2] backup: add role flag to BACKUP permission

Allow the BACKUP permission to be granted to the holder of a role via the
existing PROTECTION_FLAG_ROLE mechanism. This is a prerequisite for a
user-grantable backup transport role.

Bug: 0
Test: m framework-minus-apex
